 'cable-row':{cue:'Sit along the center of the bench, facing the cable. Place both soles against the foot supports with knees softly bent. Keep your spine neutral and chest lifted. Pull the handle toward your stomach, elbows close to the ribs. Pause, then extend under control.',tip:'Keep your hips supported and feet planted throughout; avoid rocking your torso to move the load.',url:'https://www.acefitness.org/resources/everyone/exercise-library/48/seated-row/',label:'ACE · Seated cable row'},
